<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Endurance 3x15 Tempo</name>
  <description>3x15 Tempo — level 1

WARM-UP:
-10min ramp 50%->65% FTP (RPE 2-3)

MAIN SET:
-3x 15min @ 79%-85% FTP (Z3, RPE 3-4, 90-100rpm) / 5min @ 50%-60% (Z1, RPE 1-2)

COOL-DOWN:
-10min spin-down 70%->50% FTP (RPE 2-3)

HOW TO RIDE IT:
-Steady and comfortable — hold the power, relax the upper body.

FUEL:
-40-60g carbs/hr.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.65" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="92"/>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="3" OnDuration="900" OnPower="0.82" CadenceLow="100" CadenceHigh="100" OffDuration="300" OffPower="0.55"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="600" PowerLow="0.70" PowerHigh="0.50" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>